      "body": "[YouComic.org](https://youcomic.org), an AI-powered all-in-one comic creation platform designed to make manga creation accessible to everyone.\nWith YouComic, users can generate characters, scenes, dialogues, and storyboards — no drawing skills required.\n\nOur vision is to make comic creation as easy as storytelling.\nFrom character design to scene composition, coloring, and translation, YouComic provides intelligent tools to support every step of the creative process.\n\nWhether you're a writer, artist, designer, or simply someone with a story to tell — YouComic empowers you to bring your imagination to life.",
